Package: CcSinglecell
Title: Single-Cell and miRNA Integration for Colorectal Cancer Survival Prediction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andrew", "Willems", , "awillemscf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Uses single-cell RNA-sequencing information and miRNA targeting
    information to improve colorectal cancer survival prediction. Provides
    functions for gene ranking via MAD, SwitchDE, and miRNA metrics, Cox
    proportional hazards modeling, risk score calculation, and metric weight
    optimization.
